            {"wrong": "If there was a glitch, we might to miss the deadline.", "right": "If there were a glitch, we might miss the deadline.", "note": "Never use 'to' after modal 'might'. Prefer 'were' over 'was' in conditional if-clauses.", "noteArabic": "لا تضع 'to' إطلاقاً بعد might، واعتمد were في الجملة الشرطية الافتراضية."}
